  "details": {
   "description": "Experience the refreshing sensation of Listerine Cool Mint Mouthwash, a trusted solution for maintaining comprehensive oral hygiene and achieving long-lasting freshness. Formulated with a powerful blend of clinically proven ingredients, this mouthwash effectively kills up to 99.9% of germs that cause plaque, gingivitis, and bad breath. Its antiseptic properties penetrate deep into hard-to-reach areas of the mouth, including between the teeth and along the gumline, to provide thorough cleaning and protection against harmful oral bacteria. Listerine's patented essential oil formulation deeply penetrates the plaque biofilm, removing a billion germs that brushing can miss and leaving your mouth feeling cleaner and more refreshed than brushing alone. With its invigorating cool mint flavour, this travel-friendly mouthwash offers 24-hour protection against the germs that lead to gum problems, bad breath, and plaque build-up, ensuring a clean and healthy mouth with every use.",
   "usageInstructions": "Rinse with undiluted 20ml twice a day for 30 seconds and expel.\nDo not rinse the mouth with water or eat and drink anything for 30 minutes post rinse.",
